{{ img:units/AntiAircraft.png|AntiAircraft}}
=AntiAircraft=
*  Cost: %Minerals%10
*  [[concepts/initiative|Initiative]]: 80
*  [[concepts/vehicle|Weight]]: 3
*  Base [[concepts/scanning range]]: 4
*  Sub-orbital [[concepts/scanning range]]: 5
*  Offensive turret
*  Vehicle must remain stationary to fire
*  [[concepts/attack range|Base horizontal attack range]]: 5 (AAMissile)
*  Does not require ammunition
*  1 attack per round
*  Explosion radius: 1
*  Damage: 10
This turret type can detect and attack sub-orbital planes in flight.
The AntiAircraft turret intercepts hostile mobile units during their movement [[concepts/phase]] even if itself mounted on a mobile unit. It is thus particularly well suited to establish an adhoc defense perimeter, or to persistently defend strategically important regions if mounted on a tower.
